foundation.solution_text:
$y=x^{3}$ is the basic cubic: increasing, with its point of inflection at $(0,0)$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw[<->] (-3.2,0)--(3.2,0) node[right] {$x$};
\draw[<->] (0,-3.2)--(0,3.2) node[above] {$y$};
\draw[thick,blue,<->,domain=-1.5:1.5,smooth,variable=\x] plot ({\x},{0.85*\x*\x*\x});
\fill (0,0) circle (2pt);
\node[below right] at (0,0) {$(0,0)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

